# libSceAudioIn - added for #106 (the DualSense microphone for the speaker
# calibration), which stage 6 removed.
#
# The user-routed raw PCM capture API. The SDK ships no libSceAudioIn.so, so
# this is the only way the app module can import it. /system/common/lib, not
# priv/lib.
#
# Nothing records any more, but the module stays NEEDED with the four imports
# the stage 5 build booted with on 12.70: src/evo_prx_keep.c calls each one, in
# code that never runs. Without those calls the module would be NEEDED with no
# imports at all, which the console has never loaded, and a module the loader
# rejects leaves no log. Every name here must stay referenced there, or
# package-app.sh's dead-import check stops the build.
sceAudioInOpen
sceAudioInInput
sceAudioInGetSilentState
sceAudioInClose
